  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This makes one 23cm quiche serving 6 and takes about 2 hours including chilling and resting time. The critical thing to watch is the custard: it should wobble gently in the centre when you take it out of the oven. It firms up fully as it cools."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Keep the pastry cold at every stage. Warm pastry shrinks in the tin and the sides collapse. Rest it in the fridge before rolling and again after lining the tin."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
